* wiz1stat - connection status (AT+CIPSTATUS) for the single-connection server.
* Needs: wizi. Only valid OUTSIDE passthrough (before the client connects, or after
* wiz1down); inside passthrough the text would go to the remote client.
echo * WizCon1 - connection status (AT+CIPSTATUS)
echo * Only valid OUTSIDE passthrough: before a client connects, or after wiz1down.
echo * In passthrough mode this text would go to the remote client instead.
echo AT+CIPSTATUS>/wz
modem /wz
